{'symbol': 'ROP', 'date': '2022-11-10 12:45:00', 'title': 'ROPER TECHNOLOGIES INCREASES DIVIDEND 10% - ITS 30TH CONSECUTIVE ANNUAL DIVIDEND INCREASE', 'text': 'SARASOTA, FLA., NOV. 10, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ROPER TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: ROP) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.6825 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 23, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JANUARY 9, 2023. THIS REPRESENTS AN INCREASE OF 10% OVER THE DIVIDEND PAID IN EACH QUARTER OF 2022, OR AN EXPECTED $0.25 INCREASE ON AN ANNUAL BASIS ($0.0625 ON A QUARTERLY BASIS). THIS IS THE THIRTIETH CONSECUTIVE YEAR IN WHICH ROPER HAS INCREASED ITS DIVIDEND.'}